deye.description:
Zonneburen sets the six time-of-use programs of your inverter to 00:00, 04:00, 08:00, 12:00, 16:00 and 20:00 and gives them all the same instruction every quarter: **charge from the grid**, **hold the charge**, **self-consumption** down to the minimum, or (if you allow it) **export from the battery**. Your own settings are saved first and put back when control stops.

